{"id":"70f427bb4b24622b","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-tukey.md","title":"Tukey Ordering","display":"df-tukey — Tukey Ordering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tukey","aliases":["58-df-tukey","58-thm-tukey-equivalent","Tukey Ordering"],"display":"df-tukey — Tukey Ordering","depends_on":["[[58-df-poset]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tukey"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tukey</span><span>58-thm-tukey-equivalent</span><span>Tukey Ordering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tukey — Tukey Ordering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(P,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S(U,P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S(U,P,R)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TukeyLe}_S(A,R,B,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{TukeyLe}_S(A,R,B,S)\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tukey\\text{-}directed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land\n\\forall p_0,p_1\\in P\\;\\exists p_2\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle p_0,p_2\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle p_1,p_2\\rangle\\in R\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tukey\\text{-}directed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land\n\\forall p_0,p_1\\in P\\;\\exists p_2\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle p_0,p_2\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle p_1,p_2\\rangle\\in R\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tukey\\text{-}unbounded}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S(U,P,R)\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq P\\land\n\\neg\\exists p\\in P\\;\\forall u\\in U\\;(\\langle u,p\\rangle\\in R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tukey\\text{-}unbounded}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S(U,P,R)\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq P\\land\n\\neg\\exists p\\in P\\;\\forall u\\in U\\;(\\langle u,p\\rangle\\in R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tukey}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TukeyLe}_S(A,\\leq_A,B,\\leq_B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(A,\\leq_A)\\land\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(B,\\leq_B)\\land\n\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\n\\forall U\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S(U,A,\\leq_A)\\to\n\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S(f[U],B,\\leq_B)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tukey}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TukeyLe}_S(A,\\leq_A,B,\\leq_B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(A,\\leq_A)\\land\\mathrm{DirectedPoset}_S(B,\\leq_B)\\land\n\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\n\\forall U\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S(U,A,\\leq_A)\\to\n\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S(f[U],B,\\leq_B)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tukey\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\langle A,\\leq_A\\rangle\\leq_T\\langle B,\\leq_B\\rangle\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TukeyLe}_S(A,\\leq_A,B,\\leq_B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tukey\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\langle A,\\leq_A\\rangle\\leq_T\\langle B,\\leq_B\\rangle\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TukeyLe}_S(A,\\leq_A,B,\\leq_B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tukey 关系在有向集上是预序；商去 Tukey 等价后才成为偏序。</li>\n<li>有向性、无界性和 Tukey 关系均显式接收载体及序关系；因此同一载集上的不同偏序不会被下标缩写混同。</li>\n<li>等价地，可使用反向的共尾映射刻画；仅要求某个映射的像在目标中共尾，弱于 Tukey 映射条件。</li>\n<li><code>58-thm-tukey-equivalent</code> is merged here; it repeated the same defining equivalence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":